WEBVTT

00:36.161 --> 00:38.079
- Thank you for the tour.
- Please let me know

00:38.163 --> 00:39.664
- if you are interested.
- We will.

00:43.501 --> 00:47.505
The location is right in between
Jinyowon and Songrim.

00:48.465 --> 00:50.717
And the roof tiles
and floors are clean, too.

00:50.800 --> 00:53.386
This is the best house we've seen so far.

00:53.470 --> 00:56.347
Don't you think there are
too many rooms in this house?

00:56.431 --> 00:58.183
Surely, they'll have children soon.

00:58.266 --> 01:01.311
If they have a son, he'll take
the surname Park and lead Songrim.

01:01.394 --> 01:04.981
If it's a daughter, she'll take
the surname Jin and lead Jinyowon.

01:05.065 --> 01:06.441
They should have many children.

01:07.192 --> 01:11.029
I did well to ask you to join me
on this house tour, Maidservant Kim.

01:11.112 --> 01:14.908
I will most certainly pick
the one you like the most.

01:19.788 --> 01:20.830
To be honest,

01:21.706 --> 01:25.627
I do not wish to live
in a very big house like that.

01:26.795 --> 01:29.172
I would much prefer a cozy little house

01:29.672 --> 01:33.468
where my husband
and I can live happily together.

01:35.220 --> 01:36.888
It would be nice to have a small garden

01:36.971 --> 01:38.681
where I can plant
my favorite flowers, too.

01:39.891 --> 01:42.769
You like flowers, right, Maidservant Kim?

01:45.313 --> 01:46.981
Shall I plant balsam flowers?

01:47.524 --> 01:51.069
We'll pick them when they bloom and
use them to dye each other's fingernails.

01:53.279 --> 01:56.783
It would be so wonderful
to live happily like that.

01:58.785 --> 02:01.329
I'll try to look for a house…

02:03.039 --> 02:04.332
just like that.

02:10.421 --> 02:11.548
Yes?

02:11.631 --> 02:15.093
I will plant balsam seeds in the garden

02:16.052 --> 02:17.846
of a cozy little house,

02:18.721 --> 02:21.224
and gift it to you when you get married,

02:22.684 --> 02:23.768
Maidservant Kim.

02:24.853 --> 02:25.687
Hmm?

02:27.897 --> 02:29.524
So, it'll be a gift?

02:29.607 --> 02:33.319
Since Master Lee so adored
the dog, Sapsali,

02:34.112 --> 02:37.657
I will also gift you
a small puppy like that.

02:38.324 --> 02:43.121
Are you seriously telling me that
I should wed Master Lee right now?

02:43.204 --> 02:48.334
Well, did you not say
just looking at him made you happy?

02:49.127 --> 02:54.299
Oh, you thought the person I had
feelings for was Master Lee Cheol?

02:55.216 --> 02:59.137
I, too, am at least that observant.

02:59.220 --> 03:02.891
So your observation is telling you
to give me a gift when I marry him?

03:03.558 --> 03:04.934
A house for us to live in?

03:05.560 --> 03:10.023
I can… give at least
that much as a gift for you.

03:11.024 --> 03:11.900
Why?

03:12.692 --> 03:15.987
Then buy me a house with 100 rooms.
I thought you were well-off.

03:16.571 --> 03:17.447
A hundred?

03:17.947 --> 03:19.616
Ah!

03:19.699 --> 03:22.202
Did you actually prefer a bigger house?

03:24.495 --> 03:27.624
You see, I am a bit slow.

03:27.707 --> 03:29.000
Are you an idiot?

03:30.126 --> 03:32.045
You are the one I have feelings for.

03:43.723 --> 03:44.933
I was hoping

03:46.059 --> 03:48.186
you would catch on sooner or later.

03:48.269 --> 03:52.649
While cooking your favorite dishes
and making your clothes,

03:52.732 --> 03:57.237
I thought this slow-witted man
would one day notice my true feelings.

03:58.529 --> 03:59.697
I was waiting for that.

04:00.573 --> 04:01.616
But…

04:02.242 --> 04:04.035
you want me to marry someone else?

04:04.827 --> 04:06.829
And you will buy a house for me
to live in with that man?

04:07.997 --> 04:09.165
Maid Kim.

04:09.791 --> 04:11.417
I, uh…

04:12.377 --> 04:13.670
have misunderstood you.

04:13.753 --> 04:14.754
You shut up!

04:16.464 --> 04:19.467
Today, as we were looking
at houses together just then,

04:20.677 --> 04:24.180
I dreamed of the day when the two of us
would finally be together as well.

04:24.722 --> 04:26.683
I imagined how happy I would be

04:27.350 --> 04:29.269
picking balsam flowers in my garden

04:29.811 --> 04:32.188
and lovingly grinding them
to dye each other's fingernails.

04:34.732 --> 04:36.693
Love? Love!

04:36.776 --> 04:39.237
That's right! Now, you know.

04:39.779 --> 04:40.738
Lovey-dovey together!

04:43.199 --> 04:44.826
Lovey-dovey!

04:44.909 --> 04:47.370
Yes! Oh, yes! Lovey-dovey!

04:48.663 --> 04:52.542
I can also imagine
that scene so vividly now.

04:52.625 --> 04:53.710
Forget it now.

04:53.793 --> 04:55.295
That dream has been crushed,

04:55.378 --> 04:58.089
and I will no longer expect
anything from you anymore, my lord.

04:59.007 --> 05:02.176
Oh, I will accept a house
with 100 rooms when I get married.

05:03.886 --> 05:05.930
Maidservant Kim!

05:06.764 --> 05:07.640
Maidservant Kim!

05:10.476 --> 05:11.894
Maidservant Kim. Maidservant Kim!

05:14.314 --> 05:15.481
Lovey-dovey!

05:16.607 --> 05:20.028
I… have ruined everything.

05:22.488 --> 05:23.406
You fool.

05:27.243 --> 05:28.077
Fine.

05:28.661 --> 05:31.581
Just you wait and see me get married!

05:31.664 --> 05:33.666
You'd better get me that house with rooms.

05:35.460 --> 05:37.003
Oh, Maid Kim, there you are.

05:38.087 --> 05:40.465
Maid Kim, you're crying?

05:40.548 --> 05:43.051
Of course not. Why would I?

05:45.511 --> 05:47.513
You are crying. Who made you cry?

05:47.597 --> 05:50.224
Seeing you like this
really breaks my heart.

05:51.309 --> 05:52.852
I was feeling jealous

05:52.935 --> 05:57.023
that Young Master Park is getting married
before my young master Uk.

05:57.607 --> 05:59.859
Made me jealous and upset, so I'm sad.

05:59.942 --> 06:02.987
There is no need to be jealous or upset.
I'll be getting married soon as well.

06:03.571 --> 06:04.405
What?

06:05.281 --> 06:08.743
Have you finally decided
to get married, then?

06:08.826 --> 06:12.789
Yes. So, Maidservant Kim,
you have nothing to be upset about, hmm.

06:12.872 --> 06:13.998
Gosh!

06:14.082 --> 06:16.167
Well, then I should just leave these here.

06:17.835 --> 06:19.087
What is all this?

06:19.170 --> 06:21.839
They're the wedding gifts
I prepared for when you get married.

06:22.382 --> 06:25.301
I wanted to give them
to Young Master Park and Young Lady Jin.

06:25.385 --> 06:27.595
Why would you do that, though?
That's such a waste.

06:27.678 --> 06:28.679
Indeed!

06:28.763 --> 06:31.182
I should give them
to Young Lady Heo, then?

06:32.683 --> 06:34.143
Now, why would you give her these?

06:34.227 --> 06:36.312
Gosh! You said you were getting married.

06:36.396 --> 06:37.980
I already know everything.

06:38.064 --> 06:40.066
She is your bird egg.

06:42.402 --> 06:45.363
- Bird egg?
- Your big love, that's a secret, hmm.

06:45.947 --> 06:49.784
The egret that hatches aloofly
at the top of a tall tree.

06:50.410 --> 06:52.245
Uh…

06:52.328 --> 06:55.373
I think you have misunderstood.
That is not the right bird.

06:56.374 --> 06:58.000
- It's not her?
- No.

06:58.084 --> 07:02.130
Oh, I thought it was obviously her
who would be hatched from the egg. No?

07:02.922 --> 07:05.341
Then, you're sure there is someone else?

07:06.634 --> 07:08.177
Mm-hmm, you're right.

07:09.887 --> 07:10.721
Who?

07:12.598 --> 07:15.476
Maidservant Kim,
do not be startled and just listen.

07:15.560 --> 07:16.978
If you feel like
you will bite your tongue,

07:17.061 --> 07:18.646
bite your handkerchief instead.

07:20.314 --> 07:22.650
I mean, who could it be, then?

07:23.359 --> 07:25.027
What other women do you have around you?

07:34.078 --> 07:35.371
Don't tell me…

07:36.706 --> 07:39.125
That's right. This all belongs to Mu-deok.

07:47.091 --> 07:50.511
That cannot be! It's Mu-deok?
What happened to Young Lady Heo?

07:53.681 --> 07:56.684
It looks like things worked out
for you and Young Master Jang in the end.

07:57.185 --> 07:58.060
Yes.

07:58.144 --> 08:00.438
I've decided I'm going
to get married to him.

08:00.521 --> 08:02.857
You know I am fond of spreading rumors.

08:02.940 --> 08:03.983
Please, do so.

08:04.650 --> 08:06.777
Mu-deok has changed her fate.

08:07.361 --> 08:09.322
Well, if it gets out
that he is marrying you,

08:09.405 --> 08:10.990
that will clear up all the nasty rumors.

08:11.657 --> 08:12.825
"Nasty rumors"?

08:12.909 --> 08:15.328
You know, the rumor that he was impotent

08:15.995 --> 08:17.330
because he practiced chastity.

08:18.164 --> 08:19.248
That's not true!

08:19.332 --> 08:21.751
That's what everyone said. Not true?

08:21.834 --> 08:23.711
Oh! No, definitely not!

08:23.794 --> 08:25.338
Gosh! Ah!

08:25.421 --> 08:27.006
So you've already confirmed that.

08:28.549 --> 08:29.675
What do you mean? Confirmed what?

08:29.759 --> 08:33.054
Now, I see! That is why
you've chosen to marry him.

08:33.137 --> 08:35.389
What woman would marry an impotent man

08:35.473 --> 08:37.350
even if he was from the Jang family?

08:37.433 --> 08:38.768
Do not worry, Mu-deok!

08:38.851 --> 08:40.728
I'll make sure everyone knows.

08:40.811 --> 08:42.730
"She checked, and he's definitely okay."

08:42.813 --> 08:44.440
We have not done it yet!

08:45.399 --> 08:47.360
We seriously have not done it yet!
I swear!

08:48.361 --> 08:50.655
I am older, there's no need
to be embarrassed.

08:51.322 --> 08:52.365
Goodness me!

08:54.325 --> 08:56.744
You were just full of anger
when we first met here.

08:56.827 --> 08:58.579
But you seem to have a heart now.

09:00.957 --> 09:03.417
For some reason, I always thought that

09:03.501 --> 09:05.586
you would cut all ties
and disappear one day.

09:07.380 --> 09:10.591
Well, I told you. I changed my fate.

09:11.717 --> 09:15.388
I will not disappear
and protect those I love as well.

09:16.681 --> 09:18.140
You must like him a lot.

09:21.644 --> 09:24.730
Have a good future! A happy one.

09:32.405 --> 09:36.826
I will find the sword for you
that can destroy Jang Uk's light.

09:37.451 --> 09:41.414
I, Jin Mu, am the only one
who can help you destroy the King's Star.

09:41.956 --> 09:44.041
Jang Uk has already lost all his energy.

09:45.334 --> 09:47.670
He gave up all his power
to break the barrier.

09:49.005 --> 09:52.300
He was even stripped of his right
to be the next Gwanju of Cheonbugwan.

09:52.383 --> 09:54.260
He has no power anymore.

09:55.595 --> 09:58.764
And everyone already thinks that
the King's Star from that day is mine.

10:00.808 --> 10:04.770
There is nothing more
that you can do… for me.

10:07.773 --> 10:09.942
Jang Gang may have paid
for the misdeeds of Songrim,

10:10.026 --> 10:12.069
Jinyowon, and Cheongbugwan with his death,

10:12.153 --> 10:15.156
but since Jin U-tak is still alive,
your crime will be exposed.

10:16.657 --> 10:19.201
I do not want to punish someone
who was once my master.

10:20.244 --> 10:23.414
Come forward and accept
the punishment for your crimes.

10:27.793 --> 10:29.920
Do you truly think the ice stone is gone?

10:31.964 --> 10:34.342
That power is the energy of the skies.

10:34.425 --> 10:36.886
The one born under the King's Star
and is granted permission

10:37.386 --> 10:39.180
can harness that power.

10:40.640 --> 10:42.308
What will you do if Jang Uk

10:43.559 --> 10:46.437
has that power and is merely hiding it?

10:54.236 --> 10:55.946
I will wait for your reply, Your Highness.

10:57.114 --> 10:59.617
My loyalty will forever belong to you.

11:20.262 --> 11:23.891
You haven't spoken
when you have regained consciousness.

11:26.936 --> 11:31.148
I saved you so you could have
the chance to atone for your sins

11:32.316 --> 11:33.776
to our beloved daughter,

11:35.152 --> 11:36.737
our Bu-yeon.

11:41.325 --> 11:42.827
When I first saw you…

11:45.413 --> 11:47.248
I fell for your warm smile.

11:50.751 --> 11:52.211
This one is pretty, too.

11:52.294 --> 11:56.215
I think this one will look pretty
on Bu-yeon as well.

11:59.051 --> 12:01.971
Ever since the moment
I fell for you,

12:03.347 --> 12:04.598
I truly have

12:05.975 --> 12:07.685
never been able to love

12:09.270 --> 12:10.354
anyone else.

12:17.528 --> 12:19.739
I'm not saying this to resolve anything,

12:20.614 --> 12:24.285
I'm only saying this
to make you really suffer.

12:28.164 --> 12:31.876
I just want you to understand
exactly what you did to our daughter.

12:33.210 --> 12:34.253
Jin Mu has lied.

12:34.837 --> 12:37.631
I hope you'll be in agony.

13:00.946 --> 13:02.406
Jin U-tak is in Sejukwon.

13:03.240 --> 13:04.617
He's regained consciousness.

13:05.367 --> 13:06.952
If he is still alive,

13:07.578 --> 13:10.456
it will be impossible to hide
my connection to our order.

13:10.539 --> 13:12.166
We must get rid of him.

13:18.631 --> 13:21.217
I have brought
soul potions from the apothecary

13:21.300 --> 13:24.261
and the Queen's divination bells
from the palace, as you commanded.

13:52.957 --> 13:54.667
Help, my lord!

14:05.511 --> 14:07.054
Please, spare us!

14:22.528 --> 14:24.446
With this, I can make
all the soul shifters

14:24.530 --> 14:26.949
I have created go on a rampage.

14:28.993 --> 14:31.370
If Jang Uk really does have
the ice stone's power,

14:32.580 --> 14:34.540
he will not be able to hide it.

14:41.839 --> 14:43.674
Please, craft two rings with these.

14:46.051 --> 14:48.220
Seeing how you're ordering matching rings.

14:48.304 --> 14:50.347
I guess all those rumors
are true, aren't they?

14:51.849 --> 14:54.143
They are wedding rings,
so please, take extra care, okay?

14:54.226 --> 14:57.605
Gosh, of course!
I will do my utmost. Absolutely!

14:57.688 --> 15:00.608
Please, take a look here
at these wonderful designs.

15:00.691 --> 15:01.984
Which do you like?

15:02.067 --> 15:02.985
I like this one.

15:03.068 --> 15:04.695
- Oh, no! Uh…
- Hmm.

15:06.447 --> 15:08.699
- That one is, well…
- Huh?

15:08.782 --> 15:10.576
That was Young Lady Yeong-ok's.

15:10.659 --> 15:12.620
- Oh, this one…
- Yes, yes!

15:12.703 --> 15:14.079
That's not pretty at all.

15:15.080 --> 15:16.624
Then what about this one?

15:16.707 --> 15:18.500
No! Huh…

15:18.584 --> 15:19.585
That is…

15:19.668 --> 15:21.420
- Young Lady So-jeong's.
- No! Never mind.

15:21.503 --> 15:23.172
All of these, they are all… all ugly.

15:23.255 --> 15:26.592
Then, I will take out
all the ugly ones, yes, um…

15:26.675 --> 15:30.179
All right, um, these, and, uh, these…

15:30.262 --> 15:31.639
And these too.

15:31.722 --> 15:33.933
I will put these here.
All right, all right, all right!

15:34.016 --> 15:36.518
Feel free to choose
from the remaining ones.

15:36.602 --> 15:37.811
Any of them.

15:37.895 --> 15:40.105
Seven rings?

15:52.576 --> 15:53.577
Thank you, thank you.

15:54.244 --> 15:55.287
Wait, um…

15:56.121 --> 15:59.208
I don't really think there were seven.
I don't remember a single one.

15:59.291 --> 16:02.127
Did all those rings have
similar stories to you and Cho-yeon?

16:02.211 --> 16:04.171
You promised to marry them
if they opened your gate of energy?

16:04.254 --> 16:06.048
I swear. I never made
a move with any of them.

16:06.131 --> 16:09.635
Once you said you needed to make
an effort not to like a handsome man.

16:09.718 --> 16:12.262
So, you know, all these women,
uh, did not try their very best.

16:12.346 --> 16:13.973
You're so annoying!

16:14.056 --> 16:16.308
And also, I am all yours now.

16:16.392 --> 16:17.893
Rather than winning my heart for free,

16:17.977 --> 16:19.895
don't you feel proud
to have beaten the competition?

16:20.896 --> 16:21.939
Wow!

16:22.022 --> 16:24.733
I would have been prouder
had there been a dozen more.

16:24.817 --> 16:26.402
Such a shame, right?

16:26.485 --> 16:28.070
Why? Do you think I cannot?

16:30.030 --> 16:32.032
I'm just kidding, all right?
You're the only one.

16:32.116 --> 16:33.534
I tossed the rings and forgot the girls.

16:33.617 --> 16:34.785
Hold on a minute.

16:35.744 --> 16:37.871
I did see a few rings
while I was cleaning your room.

16:38.622 --> 16:39.665
I must go and look for them.

16:39.748 --> 16:43.002
Oh! Why would you look for
such meaningless things?

16:43.085 --> 16:45.629
No, no. I think there really were
a dozen of them.

16:46.714 --> 16:48.215
Let go. I need to go check.

16:53.929 --> 16:55.180
I said there are none.

16:57.975 --> 16:59.685
Mu-deok, shall we go eat now?

17:02.479 --> 17:03.689
Be honest with me.

17:04.356 --> 17:05.441
How many rings?

17:11.030 --> 17:11.864
Just one.

17:12.364 --> 17:15.075
You are the one that
I will be wearing for the rest of my life.

17:16.326 --> 17:18.871
I have never given
such a ring to anyone else.

17:20.080 --> 17:20.956
Well…

17:22.041 --> 17:24.043
since we're wearing rings
around our fingers,

17:24.710 --> 17:27.171
we won't need to make any
with the yin-yang jade.

17:27.254 --> 17:28.130
Hmm.

17:29.840 --> 17:31.550
Should we make necklaces instead?

17:32.134 --> 17:33.677
Do as you please.

17:33.761 --> 17:35.429
I'm not jealous of Dang-gu one bit.

17:36.972 --> 17:38.057
I'm not jealous of
Cho-yeon, either.

17:38.140 --> 17:40.225
I-I guess the rumors
about those two are true.

17:40.309 --> 17:42.811
That annoying young master
is smiling all giddy.

17:44.146 --> 17:44.980
You are right.

17:45.522 --> 17:47.608
I suppose from the moment we met,

17:48.984 --> 17:50.360
I was mistaken.

17:51.445 --> 17:52.362
How embarrassing.

17:53.447 --> 17:54.573
Young Lady.

17:55.365 --> 17:59.119
Don't tell me you confessed your love
to him when you were trapped together.

17:59.745 --> 18:02.414
I was going to. And I almost did.

18:03.874 --> 18:05.084
I had my chance.

18:14.259 --> 18:16.345
You do not need to hold
that light up for me, Yun-ok.

18:16.929 --> 18:18.180
You can put it down.

18:19.973 --> 18:22.643
Are you uncomfortable
that I am here with you?

18:23.185 --> 18:24.645
I feel all right.

18:26.522 --> 18:27.856
Do as you please, then.

18:30.484 --> 18:31.610
Hmm.

18:31.693 --> 18:34.321
When you were drunk
and lying down in Sejukwon,

18:34.404 --> 18:37.074
you were comfortable with me
taking care of you all night.

18:37.616 --> 18:39.034
Because I thought you were Mu-deok.

18:50.003 --> 18:53.215
So that is the expression
he makes when he likes someone.

18:53.966 --> 18:55.676
Young Master Jang should have been the one

18:55.759 --> 18:57.594
to get hurt in there
instead of Master Seo.

18:57.678 --> 19:00.222
Then, you two could have
possibly gotten closer.

19:01.849 --> 19:03.934
Because you take care of those
who are hurt.

19:05.060 --> 19:06.520
Do you think so?

19:08.105 --> 19:09.648
Had he gotten injured…

19:12.484 --> 19:14.236
would I have had a chance?

19:21.785 --> 19:24.079
Yul, I heard you were returning
to Seoho Fortress.

19:24.163 --> 19:26.456
Yes, I decided to leave
after Dang-gu's wedding.

19:26.540 --> 19:29.293
- Let us have a farewell party before then.
- All right.

19:41.096 --> 19:43.974
You're still in pain
even though your wound has healed?

19:45.934 --> 19:49.021
I thought it would get better,
but it keeps hurting.

19:49.771 --> 19:51.815
Could you tell me
if something else happened

19:52.316 --> 19:53.734
while I was unconscious?

19:53.817 --> 19:57.738
All I did was stop the bleeding
from your open wound.

19:59.072 --> 19:59.948
Oh.

20:00.824 --> 20:03.702
So-i ran away. She gave you her blood.

20:06.580 --> 20:08.874
You cannot give blood this way, So-i.

20:09.458 --> 20:11.543
Why did you injure yourself so recklessly?

20:13.045 --> 20:14.421
I just…

20:14.504 --> 20:17.132
really wanted to save him, no matter what.

20:20.844 --> 20:23.805
Her blood was indeed
able to enter your wound.

20:24.932 --> 20:26.934
But that should not be a problem.

20:27.017 --> 20:28.352
I'm sure I will recover soon.

20:29.228 --> 20:32.105
I do not want the others to worry,
so please, keep it quiet.

20:34.566 --> 20:37.277
All right, all right. Drink up. Yeah.

20:38.654 --> 20:40.656
Hey, what are you doing there?

20:40.739 --> 20:41.657
Huh?

20:42.157 --> 20:43.951
Hey, what did you steal?

20:44.534 --> 20:46.620
Ugh! What is this? What's wrong with you?

20:46.703 --> 20:48.580
Hey! Stop there!

21:08.392 --> 21:11.603
The wound where the blood parasite
came out does not heal easily.

21:24.032 --> 21:25.951
There is a blood parasite in him.

21:30.455 --> 21:31.873
He must be in pain.

21:33.292 --> 21:36.169
He needs the medicine I took
at Jinyowon to relieve the pain.

21:42.467 --> 21:43.427
Oh, Mu-deok.

21:46.930 --> 21:49.933
You should stop being
a servant in this house now.

21:50.851 --> 21:53.603
Why? Are you kicking me out?

21:53.687 --> 21:55.731
If I really tried
kicking you out, you'd leave?

21:55.814 --> 21:58.358
- No.
- Then why would you say that

21:58.442 --> 21:59.985
if you are not going to leave anyway?

22:02.696 --> 22:04.531
Do not do such chores anymore.

22:05.615 --> 22:09.077
You will be his precious wife after all,
so I cannot make you do more chores.

22:10.495 --> 22:13.290
So, does that mean you accept me?

22:13.373 --> 22:16.168
What choice do I have
when the young master loves you that much?

22:17.961 --> 22:21.590
Oh, and also, I refuse to
address you as "my lady".

22:21.673 --> 22:22.549
Gosh.

22:22.632 --> 22:24.426
I won't consider you
my mother-in-law, either.

22:24.509 --> 22:27.346
Why would I be your mother-in-law
when I'm not married?

22:27.429 --> 22:28.430
That would hurt my pride.

22:29.056 --> 22:29.890
That's true.

22:30.724 --> 22:33.560
But you and Lord Park
will get married soon, too, won't you?

22:35.812 --> 22:37.981
I mean, that is how it looked.

22:44.446 --> 22:45.280
Goodness.

22:46.865 --> 22:48.116
M-Maidservant Kim.

22:48.992 --> 22:51.411
Even you can see it, but only he can't.

22:51.995 --> 22:53.747
- What should I do?
- Hold on.

22:53.830 --> 22:56.291
It is so obvious!
How could he possibly not know?

22:56.375 --> 22:57.584
Wow, is he a fool?

22:57.667 --> 22:59.044
He is a fool. A fool!

23:01.088 --> 23:02.214
I can't with him.

23:04.216 --> 23:08.261
That's right! Now, you know.
Lovey-dovey together.

23:09.262 --> 23:10.806
I cannot stop…

23:12.182 --> 23:13.683
thinking about

23:14.267 --> 23:15.560
what Maid Kim…

23:16.853 --> 23:18.271
has said to me.

23:28.990 --> 23:29.991
Uh, my lord.

23:35.247 --> 23:36.081
Uk.

23:36.873 --> 23:39.501
Oh, when did you get here?

23:39.584 --> 23:42.379
I have been here for a while. I had
something I want to discuss with you.

23:42.462 --> 23:45.132
What was it that
you were thinking that hard about?

23:46.174 --> 23:47.426
There is…

23:48.802 --> 23:50.095
something bothering me.

23:50.971 --> 23:53.098
So, what did you want to discuss?

23:53.181 --> 23:54.975
Oh, well, you see,

23:55.058 --> 23:57.727
I was thinking about leaving
the capital for some time

23:57.811 --> 24:00.021
after Dang-gu and Cho-yeon's wedding.

24:00.105 --> 24:01.022
Oh, I see.

24:03.358 --> 24:04.192
Then…

24:05.819 --> 24:07.404
what about Maidservant Kim?

24:08.572 --> 24:09.489
Oh.

24:09.573 --> 24:12.659
If nobody asks her to stay here,
I can't leave her alone.

24:12.742 --> 24:14.202
I'll take her with me.

24:14.911 --> 24:18.290
Who knows when we'll return.
It could be one year or ten years.

24:18.373 --> 24:20.959
Or we may end up not returning forever.

24:25.881 --> 24:28.341
I have done something

24:29.009 --> 24:31.678
unforgivable to Maidservant Kim.

24:35.015 --> 24:36.475
If I asked her to stay,

24:36.558 --> 24:39.811
do you think that she'd be with me?

24:39.895 --> 24:40.729
Hmm…

24:41.271 --> 24:42.147
Maidservant Kim…

24:44.107 --> 24:45.066
was crying.

24:52.991 --> 24:56.203
She will cry even more
if you do not ask her.

25:02.417 --> 25:04.461
I will have to…

25:06.213 --> 25:07.339
just go.

25:08.924 --> 25:09.841
Not go.

25:12.302 --> 25:13.136
Go.

25:17.974 --> 25:20.685
What is the point? Go!

25:35.784 --> 25:38.495
There is something…

25:40.372 --> 25:42.290
that I would like to show you.

25:53.260 --> 25:55.262
They are balsam flower seeds.

25:56.596 --> 25:58.223
If you plant these now,

25:59.140 --> 26:02.185
the flowers will bloom
in three to four months.

26:04.604 --> 26:08.108
I could make them bloom
in front of your eyes

26:08.191 --> 26:10.110
by using a spell right now.

26:11.278 --> 26:12.112
But…

26:14.614 --> 26:15.907
I tend to be slow.

26:21.329 --> 26:24.165
Could you wait until they sprout,

26:26.001 --> 26:27.544
bud leaves and then…

26:33.883 --> 26:35.802
finally bloom into flowers?

27:08.793 --> 27:09.753
I will.

27:15.759 --> 27:16.593
I will

27:17.886 --> 27:18.970
try to go with…

27:20.221 --> 27:21.306
your slow pace.

27:39.240 --> 27:42.702
Looks like this gift will only
interrupt them now.

28:02.263 --> 28:03.098
Whoa!

28:03.181 --> 28:05.975
Thank you. We will enjoy the fish.

28:06.059 --> 28:07.143
Thank you.

28:18.613 --> 28:19.614
Did you see?

28:20.156 --> 28:22.742
That man was crying.

28:22.826 --> 28:27.163
I have never seen an adult cry
with their nose running like that before.

28:28.331 --> 28:30.625
He must not be feeling well.

28:30.709 --> 28:31.918
Do you think so?

28:59.362 --> 29:00.572
Are you all right?

29:01.322 --> 29:03.408
Here. I've brought you some medicine.

29:03.491 --> 29:04.534
You should take it.

29:12.083 --> 29:15.378
Once we get Shaman Choi's brother
who is in Sejukwon to start talking,

29:15.462 --> 29:17.255
we'll be able to catch Jin Mu.

29:17.338 --> 29:20.341
There is something I must ask Jin Mu.

29:22.260 --> 29:24.846
Whether my father chose
to become a soul shifter

29:24.929 --> 29:27.265
or if there was a story behind it.

29:27.891 --> 29:29.267
Only he will know that.

29:31.519 --> 29:34.773
Lord Cho Chung passed away
because of Gwanju Jang Gang.

29:35.648 --> 29:38.985
Lord Cho Chung found out
that the Gwanju had practiced sorcery.

29:39.611 --> 29:41.321
Afraid that he would tell everyone,

29:41.404 --> 29:44.616
Jin Mu decided to turn him into
a soul shifter and made him run wild.

29:44.699 --> 29:46.326
Are you telling me

29:46.409 --> 29:49.037
we killed Lord Cho
when he was actually innocent?

29:55.502 --> 29:56.628
It is not our fault.

29:57.420 --> 29:59.255
We were not aware of the actual truth.

30:00.215 --> 30:02.717
Lord Cho is in fact wrongly accused

30:02.801 --> 30:05.553
of practicing sorcery
and killing his own family.

30:05.637 --> 30:09.307
The Gwanju implored that at least
we should try and clear Lord Cho's name.

30:09.390 --> 30:13.895
Hmm, we should discuss this
at the next Unanimous Assembly.

30:13.978 --> 30:17.148
But why did Jin Mu go
that far with Cho Chung?

30:17.232 --> 30:19.400
If he just wanted to silence Lord Cho,

30:19.484 --> 30:23.279
he should not have had a reason
to turn him into a soul shifter

30:23.363 --> 30:24.739
and to make him a killer.

30:27.033 --> 30:27.867
Jin Mu…

30:28.785 --> 30:32.330
knows everything about Uk's birth.

30:33.665 --> 30:35.083
He did that to Cho Chung,

30:35.166 --> 30:36.835
a friend of Jang Gang,

30:38.461 --> 30:40.547
solely to torture the Gwanju.

30:40.630 --> 30:41.673
That means…

30:43.132 --> 30:46.469
if Jin Mu is really caught,
he is going to expose

30:47.929 --> 30:49.180
Young Master's secret.

30:49.264 --> 30:52.851
To stop that from happening,
we have to find him,

30:54.936 --> 30:56.688
and kill him immediately.

31:10.869 --> 31:14.539
If you curse
the Soul Ejector with divination,

31:14.622 --> 31:18.668
you can control the soul
that has been using it.

31:30.638 --> 31:33.057
In other words,
you can make them run wild,

31:33.892 --> 31:36.978
and then get rid of them by petrification.

31:47.405 --> 31:48.656
Shaman Choi

31:49.908 --> 31:54.329
cursed all Soul Ejectors back then
when she made them with divination.

31:55.121 --> 31:59.208
That is why I have never tried
to shift souls to this day.

32:00.919 --> 32:02.712
I will make all soul shifters

32:02.795 --> 32:06.549
in this capital run wild
just like Cho Chung.

32:12.263 --> 32:13.181
Assistant Gwanju.

32:14.265 --> 32:16.434
They say Jang Uk is going
to leave Jeongjingak.

32:18.227 --> 32:20.146
Songrim is letting him go?

32:20.229 --> 32:21.230
That is what I heard.

32:21.314 --> 32:23.483
Rumor has it that
he's leaving the capital as well.

32:23.566 --> 32:25.902
He will leave all of this behind?

32:25.985 --> 32:29.238
If the only person who will go
against the Crown Prince disappears…

32:29.322 --> 32:31.366
There is nothing more that you can do…

32:32.575 --> 32:33.451
for me.

32:34.410 --> 32:36.704
Why in the world is Uk leaving Songrim?

32:36.788 --> 32:40.208
He even consumed poison to get in there
and reached Chisu at an unbelievable pace.

32:40.291 --> 32:43.252
And now! He may even have
the ice stone's power,

32:43.336 --> 32:44.796
so what is it? Tell me why!

32:49.425 --> 32:52.178
Perhaps, he had
a change of heart, my lord.

32:57.225 --> 32:59.644
So what you're saying
is that he's changed.

32:59.727 --> 33:01.688
What could have caused him
to change like that?

33:04.023 --> 33:06.025
What could have caused him to change?

33:06.693 --> 33:10.113
People can only change for other people.

33:11.572 --> 33:14.867
Find the person who appeared
just when he began changing.

33:17.245 --> 33:18.663
That's your answer.

33:19.455 --> 33:22.667
The person who appeared
just when he began changing.

33:23.334 --> 33:25.545
I'm here to acquire Naksu's sword, sir.

33:27.964 --> 33:31.259
That is ridiculous.
It could not have been Naksu.

33:33.094 --> 33:34.971
Jang Uk used Naksu's Tansu.

33:35.555 --> 33:36.472
No.

33:37.890 --> 33:39.976
Master Lee must have taught him that.

33:40.059 --> 33:43.104
I witnessed everything while
he was living with me in Danhyanggok.

33:43.187 --> 33:46.816
And the only one at his side
was none other than his young servant.

33:54.699 --> 33:55.825
By any chance,

33:56.909 --> 33:59.328
is he leaving Songrim with his servant?

33:59.871 --> 34:01.998
Yes, my lord. I heard that
he is leaving with Mu-deok,

34:02.498 --> 34:04.917
the servant who has always
been following him around.

34:21.017 --> 34:23.019
Is it even right
for me to ask you to come with me?

34:23.644 --> 34:25.480
You said you had a lot to buy.

34:26.022 --> 34:27.023
I'll help you carry it.

34:33.738 --> 34:35.406
If it really is her…

35:25.081 --> 35:26.541
Hello, Mu-deok.

35:36.467 --> 35:39.053
- Are you all right?
- Yes.

35:39.720 --> 35:41.639
Did you not hear me calling you?

35:44.016 --> 35:45.017
I did.

35:45.852 --> 35:48.146
Why could I not answer you?

35:49.856 --> 35:51.816
Did you hear bells, by any chance?

35:52.692 --> 35:55.027
Hear bells? No, I did not.

35:55.611 --> 35:57.864
Hey, the quality here is not good.
Let's go, let's go.

35:57.947 --> 35:58.781
Yes.

36:02.243 --> 36:03.077
Naksu.

36:04.912 --> 36:07.248
You have given me a way to live.

36:15.798 --> 36:18.509
Oh! Oh, Master Lee, a fish!
A fish, a fish!

36:19.177 --> 36:20.970
Ugh.

36:21.637 --> 36:22.513
Master Lee.

36:22.597 --> 36:25.808
Oh, come on now.
How many times have you let them go, huh?

36:26.434 --> 36:28.686
I have no regrets over the fish I've lost.

36:28.769 --> 36:30.438
What does that mean?

36:30.521 --> 36:32.940
If you lose them, it's just a total waste.

36:34.233 --> 36:36.027
This is just mere greed and obsession.

36:36.110 --> 36:36.944
What?

36:37.737 --> 36:42.867
However, within the loss, I encountered
the pure sadness it has brought.

36:46.412 --> 36:51.083
Lately, I've been coming to understand
why people feel sad

36:51.167 --> 36:53.252
when they see a river flowing,

36:53.336 --> 36:56.172
a season passing by, and the sun setting.

37:06.140 --> 37:08.643
Looking at this empty basket makes me sad.

37:08.726 --> 37:10.811
Mu-deok told me
to catch a lot of fish for her.

37:11.395 --> 37:13.773
Are you going to keep
that soul shifter by your side?

37:17.818 --> 37:20.196
Mu-deok and I both kept
our promise to you.

37:20.905 --> 37:22.782
I stood by the way of Naksu's sword,

37:22.865 --> 37:24.825
and Mu-deok lowered her blade on her own.

37:24.909 --> 37:30.206
So, I hope you will keep
your promise and just let both of us go.

37:30.289 --> 37:32.416
What happened to the ice stone that day?

37:33.542 --> 37:37.088
Is it not inside of your body, perhaps?

37:51.727 --> 37:53.854
Even if the ice stone is inside my body,

37:54.939 --> 37:56.941
it is completely useless to me.

37:57.024 --> 38:01.195
I can't even catch a waterdrop,
let alone a Golden Fish from this lake.

38:03.990 --> 38:08.077
If you train again,
you may be able to use that power.

38:08.661 --> 38:10.705
I witnessed first-hand how that desire

38:10.788 --> 38:14.041
to harness that power made
human beings so violent and unsightly.

38:14.959 --> 38:18.129
It's only right to let it
be gone from this world.

38:20.172 --> 38:23.259
A boy who is greedy over a single fish

38:23.342 --> 38:25.344
has no desire for the ice stone?

38:25.428 --> 38:28.264
Ha! You are better than me, I guess.

38:31.517 --> 38:34.937
In any case,
since the ice stone is within me,

38:36.105 --> 38:38.274
I can protect at least
one person beside me.

38:39.358 --> 38:42.611
If Mu-deok runs wild by chance,

38:42.695 --> 38:46.157
please, help her use
this power to stop it, Master Lee.

38:46.240 --> 38:48.909
As long as she doesn't try
to bring out her power in that body,

38:48.993 --> 38:50.244
she will not run wild.

38:51.329 --> 38:54.957
Because the soul of an assassin
is in that tiny, weak body,

38:55.041 --> 38:57.752
if anything, she should have
run wild a long time ago.

38:57.835 --> 38:59.628
But the reason why she hasn't

38:59.712 --> 39:03.090
is that body is in control
of her soul's power.

39:04.717 --> 39:07.303
I saw that very clearly
on the day we first met.

39:12.683 --> 39:15.227
The ability to contain
the powers of a mage

39:15.311 --> 39:17.438
is the divine power of priestesses.

39:18.981 --> 39:22.193
It seems the original owner
of Mu-deok's body

39:22.943 --> 39:25.404
used to have
a great amount of divine powers.

39:49.470 --> 39:51.389
This will ease the pain
from the blood parasite.

39:52.556 --> 39:55.601
But only ease the pain,
it cannot get rid of it.

39:57.478 --> 39:59.480
I need to give this to him at least.

40:06.821 --> 40:09.657
So, it turns out
you have dug your own grave.

40:11.992 --> 40:14.620
How dare you deceive me
pretending to be my daughter,

40:15.287 --> 40:16.163
So-i?

40:18.874 --> 40:20.292
But you were not fooled, Mother.

40:20.793 --> 40:23.546
You quickly realized,
but feigned ignorance.

40:25.089 --> 40:26.799
Was it all because of that rock?

40:28.467 --> 40:29.301
Right.

40:29.802 --> 40:32.930
A mother could never fail
to recognize her child.

40:34.598 --> 40:36.142
To stop any more trouble,

40:36.225 --> 40:39.895
it is best that you die here and now.

40:41.897 --> 40:43.274
Can you also…

40:44.817 --> 40:46.110
recognize this?

40:46.944 --> 40:49.113
It is what Bu-yeon was wearing
the day she disappeared.

40:50.614 --> 40:52.533
You said you embroidered it yourself,
didn't you?

41:04.003 --> 41:06.172
You! Where did you get this?

41:06.714 --> 41:08.924
Did Jin Mu also put you up to this?

41:11.260 --> 41:12.178
Oh, no.

41:13.179 --> 41:16.849
Only I know… who the owner is.

41:16.932 --> 41:18.142
Who is it? Tell me.

41:19.643 --> 41:21.479
Your daughter, Bu-yeon, is still alive.

41:23.105 --> 41:24.440
If you want to see her again,

41:25.191 --> 41:26.984
you cannot kill me.

41:29.570 --> 41:30.696
I'll spare you.

41:31.280 --> 41:33.115
Where is Bu-yeon? My Bu-yeon!

41:37.328 --> 41:38.579
Don't rush me like this.

41:40.623 --> 41:44.335
I will tell you next time…
once I know I'm safe.

42:01.393 --> 42:03.020
The ice stone has disappeared.

42:03.562 --> 42:06.190
But there are still
soul shifters created by

42:06.273 --> 42:08.442
the Choi family's secret organization.

42:09.151 --> 42:12.821
Songrim and Jinyowon will step forward
to get rid of them.

42:13.822 --> 42:16.659
I ask that you join
our cause, Your Highness.

42:20.329 --> 42:25.125
You are implying that I should not
protect Assistant Gwanju Jin Mu.

42:25.209 --> 42:29.797
I know he was your master but I believe
you didn't fall to his trickery.

42:32.299 --> 42:33.425
So you trust me?

42:34.885 --> 42:36.053
Then do you believe

42:37.137 --> 42:40.015
that I am truly the King's Star
who got rid of the ice stone?

42:44.728 --> 42:47.731
You were there
when the ice stone's barrier was lifted,

42:47.815 --> 42:50.317
and the King's Star appeared right then.

42:51.318 --> 42:55.114
So like everyone else,
I believe you are the King's Star.

42:59.952 --> 43:02.746
There was another person
in this place besides me.

43:04.039 --> 43:06.625
Who would mind them
when Your Royal Highness

43:07.918 --> 43:09.253
is the one who is here?

43:09.336 --> 43:11.338
That other person
who was there was Jang Uk.

43:12.339 --> 43:13.549
I am sure you saw him there.

43:15.968 --> 43:17.845
Jang Uk is like a son to me.

43:19.013 --> 43:21.265
Thanks to Your Highness, he is safe now.

43:22.266 --> 43:24.310
I am truly grateful for that.

43:35.029 --> 43:37.781
I'm quitting my job
here at Songrim today, too.

43:37.865 --> 43:39.116
I came to resign.

43:41.410 --> 43:44.622
Gosh, you went through
so much effort to finally land this job.

43:44.705 --> 43:47.041
It's really a shame you're quitting
because you're getting married.

43:47.708 --> 43:50.294
Then again, you are becoming
the lady of the Jang family.

43:50.377 --> 43:51.337
I suppose it's worth it.

43:53.213 --> 43:56.133
Oh! Mu-deok, congratulations.

43:56.216 --> 43:57.051
Be happy.

44:03.849 --> 44:05.684
All right, all right.
What are you doing, huh?

44:05.768 --> 44:06.602
Come along now.

44:07.353 --> 44:08.812
Hmm? Hurry up!

44:10.230 --> 44:11.065
Hurry up!

44:14.902 --> 44:17.446
Your Royal Highness,
thank you for saving my life.

44:17.946 --> 44:19.073
I am honored.

44:20.324 --> 44:23.661
May the light of the King's Star
shine forever and always!

44:23.744 --> 44:25.954
That is enough. Don't pretend.

44:26.538 --> 44:27.456
It's uncomfortable.

44:30.084 --> 44:33.420
You already know that it was Jang Uk
who saved everyone that day, not me.

44:33.504 --> 44:37.716
Just as you two have promised,
I won't tell anyone,

44:37.800 --> 44:38.967
so do not worry about it.

44:40.969 --> 44:42.012
Do you think I am worried

44:42.096 --> 44:44.223
because someone might find out
that I took the credit?

44:44.306 --> 44:46.934
I'm just annoyed in having to
sit and listen to everyone's flattery.

44:47.017 --> 44:49.311
They are all praising you
for doing a great job.

44:49.853 --> 44:53.107
You can just enjoy it
and accept it for what it is.

44:53.190 --> 44:55.984
It's very offensive to me to hear
such things from those strangers.

44:56.694 --> 44:58.404
And seeing how you bow before me…

45:00.531 --> 45:02.866
feels like you are mocking me,
and it makes my insides turn.

45:08.497 --> 45:10.582
I understand why you feel uncomfortable.

45:12.876 --> 45:15.462
You will actually never
have to see ever me again,

45:16.046 --> 45:17.131
so do not worry.

45:19.174 --> 45:20.050
I heard…

45:21.635 --> 45:24.138
- you are going far away with him.
- Yes, Your Highness.

45:24.221 --> 45:27.516
We are preparing to go and live together
somewhere far from the capital.

45:28.142 --> 45:29.184
Together?

45:32.062 --> 45:34.106
If I stop you, you cannot leave together.

45:34.857 --> 45:36.734
Do you really think I will let Jang Uk go

45:37.735 --> 45:39.361
even though he knows my weakness?

45:42.156 --> 45:44.700
Then how would it feel
to see that person by keeping

45:45.534 --> 45:46.577
them next to you?

45:49.621 --> 45:53.041
I imagine it would not stop at just making
your insides turn and offending you.

45:59.381 --> 46:00.215
Right.

46:00.883 --> 46:03.761
You are Filthy Mu-deok
who listens to all my petty complaints.

46:04.845 --> 46:06.847
Then, I would suggest
you listen to this as well.

46:07.681 --> 46:10.809
I will feel small knowing that he did
something that I failed to do.

46:11.435 --> 46:14.646
And pretending that I have done something
I did not will make me feel pathetic.

46:14.730 --> 46:15.647
But most of all…

46:17.816 --> 46:19.735
I will utterly despise…

46:21.904 --> 46:24.698
seeing you with him so much
I will be unable to bear it.

46:28.535 --> 46:29.620
I told you

46:29.703 --> 46:33.165
that I do not try to catch things
I know I will not be able to.

46:33.248 --> 46:36.001
Do you know what I do when I cannot
catch it even though I try?

46:37.878 --> 46:39.963
Will you blame
that person you cannot catch

46:41.340 --> 46:42.466
and get rid of them?

46:43.050 --> 46:46.887
If this pathetic, wretched feeling
turns into a violent and wicked one…

46:49.681 --> 46:52.726
simply avoiding me will never
be enough to keep you safe.

46:55.354 --> 46:57.481
You need to disappear to a faraway place…

46:59.274 --> 47:00.567
out of my reach.

47:14.832 --> 47:15.833
Guys…

47:17.084 --> 47:20.420
- I am getting married tomorrow!
- Yeah, yeah, wow.

47:24.258 --> 47:26.134
You little boys.

47:26.218 --> 47:29.847
I suppose I will not get to see
you guys like this often anymore.

47:29.930 --> 47:30.848
Of course not.

47:30.931 --> 47:33.976
There's no way Cho-yeon would ever
let you have fun like this.

47:34.059 --> 47:35.853
- Neither will his mother-in-law.
- No, hmm.

47:37.020 --> 47:38.605
He will no longer
have the pleasure to come

47:39.314 --> 47:40.941
- to our gyeokgu matches, for sure.
- Hmm.

47:41.024 --> 47:43.068
We definitely won't be able
to invite him to fishing.

47:44.069 --> 47:47.072
Well, I can still make time
and see you guys now and then.

47:47.155 --> 47:47.990
What will you tell her?

47:48.073 --> 47:49.908
That you are training or something?

47:49.992 --> 47:52.786
Are you seriously going to lie
to a Jinyowon priestess?

47:52.870 --> 47:53.745
He will be caught right away.

47:53.829 --> 47:57.165
Cho-yeon will grab you and surround you
with relics from Jinyowon, huh?

47:57.249 --> 47:58.709
She will demand the truth from you,

47:58.792 --> 48:00.544
and then, you will be bewitched
and tell her everything.

48:01.128 --> 48:03.839
- Then she will pull out all of--
- His hair, his hair, his hair!

48:03.922 --> 48:04.923
Oh, dear, that is--

48:05.007 --> 48:06.758
He doesn't even have
that much hair, to begin with.

48:11.680 --> 48:13.891
Ah, I see. You are just envious.

48:14.975 --> 48:16.977
I am still happy

48:17.060 --> 48:19.813
because my first love
has really come true.

48:20.689 --> 48:24.860
I will share lots of my good energy
and luck with you bachelors, huh?

48:27.321 --> 48:30.324
- I caught it.
- Oh, right, Uk, you have Mu-deok.

48:30.407 --> 48:32.492
- That's right.
- And she is not your first.

48:32.576 --> 48:35.287
- She is, what, your eighth love?
- No.

48:35.370 --> 48:37.247
You better not say that
to Mu-deok, or else I'll kill you.

48:37.331 --> 48:39.708
Ah, okay, okay. All right. Forget it then.

48:39.791 --> 48:42.294
Yul, you can take my energy. Ah, take it!

48:42.377 --> 48:43.211
That's fine.

48:44.546 --> 48:45.672
I was rejected.

48:45.756 --> 48:46.924
What?

48:47.007 --> 48:47.883
By whom?

48:49.301 --> 48:50.928
N-not by Mu-deok?

48:52.721 --> 48:53.555
Oh…

48:54.306 --> 48:55.807
No, not that.

48:56.600 --> 48:59.519
The woman I had feelings for
was not Mu-deok.

49:01.063 --> 49:02.022
Oh…

49:03.357 --> 49:05.692
Um, well, who then?

49:06.693 --> 49:08.278
Hey, Uk, do you know?

49:08.904 --> 49:10.781
Well, um, I guess I have a hunch.

49:11.823 --> 49:12.908
Oh.

49:15.786 --> 49:19.247
So, have you decided
where you are going with Mu-deok?

49:19.331 --> 49:21.917
Well, we are thinking of Sari Village.

49:22.000 --> 49:23.460
There's something that
I want to ask around.

49:23.543 --> 49:26.880
Then, are you all prepared to go
back to Seoho Fortress now?

49:27.589 --> 49:29.716
You said you would be leaving
right after my wedding, Yul?

49:29.800 --> 49:31.259
It seems like I will have to delay.

49:32.094 --> 49:33.637
I might need more treatment.

49:33.720 --> 49:34.930
What? Does it still hurt?

49:35.430 --> 49:37.265
I heard the wound had
already healed, though.

49:37.349 --> 49:39.768
What? Is Master Heo a quack?

49:40.602 --> 49:43.605
The wound has healed,
but I still feel some pain.

49:45.232 --> 49:46.191
I will be fine.

50:00.789 --> 50:01.957
Young Master Seo.

50:03.375 --> 50:05.544
I do not know
if I should give this to you.

50:05.627 --> 50:08.964
But a beggar I met on the side of the road
pleaded with me to deliver this.

50:21.018 --> 50:22.394
This medicine will relieve

50:22.477 --> 50:24.813
the tightening pain
you feel around your heart.

50:25.355 --> 50:26.690
You must take it.

50:28.358 --> 50:30.277
It is someone
who knows my current condition.

50:31.153 --> 50:31.987
Who could it be?

50:43.582 --> 50:46.209
I knew you would come back
to see me, Your Royal Highness.

50:48.003 --> 50:51.214
There is nothing that Jang Uk can do,
so I will cast him far away.

50:51.298 --> 50:53.550
As for the ice stone, he doesn't have it.

50:54.134 --> 50:56.511
Come forward and pay for your crimes
by the end of the day.

50:57.054 --> 50:58.138
And if you do not…

51:00.682 --> 51:02.601
I will have to capture my own master.

51:05.896 --> 51:08.148
Everyone is deceiving you.

51:11.109 --> 51:13.487
Did you meet with Songrim's leader today?

51:14.029 --> 51:15.697
What did he say to you?

51:15.781 --> 51:18.909
Did he congratulate you
for being the real King's Star?

51:19.785 --> 51:23.455
He is well aware that
it's not you, but it is Jang Uk.

51:25.832 --> 51:27.542
Do you think Master Lee does not know?

51:28.168 --> 51:29.377
He barged into the palace

51:29.461 --> 51:32.422
and mentioned the King's Star,
all the while knowing.

51:35.467 --> 51:39.012
Are you saying that they all deceived me
and have been mocking me this whole time?

51:39.096 --> 51:41.389
They are hiding it to protect him.

51:42.099 --> 51:45.393
Jang Uk has the power
of the ice stone and Songrim's protection.

51:45.477 --> 51:48.522
The only one you can trust
to protect you is just me, Jin Mu.

51:53.527 --> 51:55.695
Jang Uk is hiding something tremendous.

51:56.488 --> 51:57.739
I will expose it…

51:59.574 --> 52:05.372
and… send him all the way
to rock bottom where he belongs.

52:15.048 --> 52:16.049
That's right.

52:17.134 --> 52:19.553
Huh, what? Who drank it all?

52:19.636 --> 52:20.846
Your glass is empty.

52:20.929 --> 52:23.014
It was you? You drank it all.

52:23.640 --> 52:25.225
Empty! Pour me some, then.

52:25.308 --> 52:26.726
- Right.
- Have some.

52:26.810 --> 52:29.354
"Have some"? How dare you say that?

52:29.437 --> 52:31.648
- "Have some"?
- What will you do about it?

52:32.190 --> 52:33.900
Oh, Young Master Jang.

52:34.442 --> 52:38.947
Young Master Jang, hah,
we were having a drink to celebrate

52:39.030 --> 52:41.658
- Mu-deok's resignation from Songrim today.
- Huh.

52:41.741 --> 52:44.244
- Hi, Jang Uk.
- Hey!

52:44.828 --> 52:46.955
- How dare you call him "Jang Uk"?
- Ah!

52:47.497 --> 52:50.083
Sorry. My mistake.

52:50.167 --> 52:52.294
- That's right.
- These two have had a few drinks.

52:52.377 --> 52:55.589
Oh, Young Master Jang.
Come here. Come, come!

52:58.592 --> 53:02.095
Let me show you something really so cool.

53:02.179 --> 53:03.638
When Mu-deok is drunk…

53:03.722 --> 53:06.808
- Hmm?
- …she does not speak in dialect at all.

53:06.892 --> 53:08.393
Oh!

53:08.476 --> 53:10.061
Is that fascinating?

53:10.645 --> 53:11.730
- A pity…
- Huh?

53:11.813 --> 53:13.815
…that I cannot show you.

53:15.150 --> 53:17.986
But I can fly up to that roof.

53:18.069 --> 53:20.363
The roof? Really? Go try it.

53:20.447 --> 53:22.282
- Try it?
- Try it.

53:23.617 --> 53:24.576
Watch closely.

53:25.243 --> 53:26.077
Huh?

53:31.708 --> 53:33.919
- Darn it. Hold on. Damn it.
- Oh.

53:36.671 --> 53:38.089
- Oh, you-- All right.
- It's not working, it's not.

53:38.173 --> 53:39.132
Just sit.

53:42.886 --> 53:44.804
Cannot draw my sword either.

53:44.888 --> 53:46.556
What? That?

53:46.640 --> 53:47.849
That sword is not yours.

53:47.933 --> 53:49.226
That was Naksu's.

53:50.060 --> 53:51.394
- Young Master.
- Oh, yes?

53:51.478 --> 53:55.690
Why do you keep bringing that thing
in here when I told you it's hideous?

53:55.774 --> 53:57.651
Oh, right. I'm going
to get rid of it. I will.

53:58.652 --> 54:00.320
- Let me try it again.
- Go on.

54:00.403 --> 54:02.405
- Sure. Try it. Fly.
- Let me try.

54:02.489 --> 54:03.698
Go on.

54:04.324 --> 54:05.158
Up!

54:05.825 --> 54:06.826
- Oh.
- Ugh, there.

54:06.910 --> 54:07.786
- Wow.
- Huh?

54:07.869 --> 54:10.247
- Maidservant Kim, please, clean this up.
- Did you see that?

54:10.330 --> 54:12.123
- I'll take care of Mu-deok.
- Wait, I can fly.

54:12.207 --> 54:14.125
- And do not fly, do not fly.
- I told you.

54:14.209 --> 54:16.086
She really, really did fly.

54:17.212 --> 54:19.214
Lord Park, did you see that?

54:19.297 --> 54:21.049
I want you to fly with me.

54:21.132 --> 54:24.094
You guys have no idea who I am.

54:24.177 --> 54:27.264
I am the true master of it all.
I'll show you.

54:30.809 --> 54:31.935
I am the master.

54:32.018 --> 54:34.271
Not working. Today is not my day.

54:41.528 --> 54:43.613
Mu-deok, do not drink ever again.

54:43.697 --> 54:45.657
You'll tell everyone that
you are actually Naksu.

54:45.740 --> 54:46.574
Huh.

54:48.493 --> 54:50.245
I have something to tell you.

54:50.328 --> 54:51.997
Sleep now. Tell me tomorrow.

54:53.707 --> 54:54.916
I must say it now.

54:55.542 --> 54:58.420
What if I do not tell you
and then I die tomorrow?

54:59.087 --> 55:01.464
Fine, tell me. Before you die, go on.

55:01.548 --> 55:02.382
Tell me.

55:07.220 --> 55:08.054
Listen.

55:11.558 --> 55:13.143
Jang Uk, I like you a lot.

55:31.536 --> 55:33.830
Oh! Oh, I see. And now, it's bedtime.

55:33.913 --> 55:35.790
You do that and just fall asleep?

55:38.752 --> 55:41.296
I need to tell her
what Master Lee said, too.

55:43.506 --> 55:46.593
It seems
the original owner of Mu-deok's body

55:47.093 --> 55:49.346
used to have
a great amount of divine powers.

55:50.805 --> 55:53.141
We will find out
once I get to Sari Village with you.

55:54.726 --> 55:55.810
Hmm.

56:00.815 --> 56:01.649
Hmm.

57:24.899 --> 57:26.276
Be happy!

57:35.952 --> 57:39.080
Both of you, let bygones be bygones.

57:39.164 --> 57:41.374
And be good in-laws to each other.

57:42.709 --> 57:45.253
Our Cho-yeon is not marrying
into the Park family.

57:45.837 --> 57:48.673
Park Dang-gu is the one
who is marrying into ours.

57:49.799 --> 57:51.092
He's not moving to Jinyowon.

57:51.843 --> 57:54.804
It's because you keep saying
such things that people are talking

57:54.888 --> 57:57.474
about how Park Dang-gu
is to become Jin Dang-gu.

57:59.184 --> 58:01.728
Their daughter will be given our surname.

58:01.811 --> 58:03.146
Their son will have ours.

58:03.229 --> 58:06.900
Hey, now! You are arguing again! Why now?

58:06.983 --> 58:08.902
The guests will be arriving soon.

58:08.985 --> 58:11.237
You should go get ready to greet them.

58:11.905 --> 58:14.282
Go on. Go, go, go!

58:16.826 --> 58:17.660
Where is Dang-gu?

58:18.161 --> 58:20.205
He said he is going
to Sejukwon with Cho-yeon first.

58:20.788 --> 58:23.500
They're going to sneak inside
to pay respects to her father.

58:24.667 --> 58:25.710
Where is Mu-deok?

58:27.545 --> 58:30.006
I don't know. I thought she went ahead,
but I haven't seen her.

58:31.591 --> 58:34.093
Is she avoiding me now
because of last night?

59:38.783 --> 59:39.617
Naksu.

59:41.035 --> 59:43.913
You cannot draw your sword
because you are stuck in that body.

59:45.123 --> 59:47.417
You are my last weapon anyway.

59:48.293 --> 59:51.254
I will use all my power
to help bring out yours.

59:52.213 --> 59:54.007
So once you regain your energy,

59:55.091 --> 59:56.217
run wild.

01:00:54.150 --> 01:00:57.153
Only I know who the owner is.

01:00:57.904 --> 01:00:59.864
Your daughter, Bu-yeon, is still alive.

01:01:01.240 --> 01:01:02.283
Oh, Mother.

01:01:13.503 --> 01:01:14.462
Maidservant Kim.

01:01:20.677 --> 01:01:23.846
Where did that servant,
Mu-deok, use to live?

01:01:25.306 --> 01:01:28.142
Does she… have parents?

01:01:29.102 --> 01:01:32.355
No, she does not.
I heard she grew up in Sari Village.

01:01:33.523 --> 01:01:35.983
I told you all of this before
when she was falsely accused

01:01:36.067 --> 01:01:37.360
because of that girl, So-i.

01:01:38.403 --> 01:01:39.779
I asked you to help that girl.

01:01:40.947 --> 01:01:42.407
You didn't pretend to hear me.

01:01:43.700 --> 01:01:46.369
Does So-i know about Mu-deok?

01:01:47.161 --> 01:01:50.081
Right. Young Lady Jin also knows her.

01:01:56.212 --> 01:01:57.922
You are so beautiful.

01:02:00.216 --> 01:02:03.052
Well, you are handsome as well.

01:02:06.472 --> 01:02:08.891
Uh, let us go and greet your father.

01:02:09.934 --> 01:02:11.686
We cannot stay there for long.

01:02:12.270 --> 01:02:14.897
If the others find out,
they will give us an earful.

01:02:16.023 --> 01:02:16.858
Yes.

01:02:18.025 --> 01:02:19.152
Thank you so much…

01:02:20.695 --> 01:02:23.156
hus-ba-- husband.

01:02:25.491 --> 01:02:26.701
Oh.

01:02:28.619 --> 01:02:29.620
Be careful…

01:02:31.748 --> 01:02:32.582
my wife.

01:02:33.833 --> 01:02:34.917
My dear wife.

01:02:36.377 --> 01:02:37.712
Oh, wait for me.

01:02:43.092 --> 01:02:46.095
Mu-deok? What are you doing here?

01:02:51.684 --> 01:02:54.854
Mu-deok, you cannot bring that in here.

01:02:57.690 --> 01:02:59.859
First, kill Jin U-tak.

01:03:05.948 --> 01:03:06.908
Mu-deok!

01:03:37.939 --> 01:03:39.357
What is happening?

01:03:41.859 --> 01:03:42.693
You…

01:03:43.736 --> 01:03:45.655
you are Jang Uk's servant, right?

01:03:46.239 --> 01:03:47.365
What's going on?

01:04:13.432 --> 01:04:14.934
Kill Jin U-tak.

01:04:22.984 --> 01:04:24.110
Father!

01:04:26.279 --> 01:04:27.446
Father!

01:04:30.658 --> 01:04:31.742
Mu-deok.

01:04:31.826 --> 01:04:32.910
What are you doing?

01:04:32.994 --> 01:04:33.870
She is…

01:04:34.579 --> 01:04:37.290
she is an assassin.

01:04:38.040 --> 01:04:39.208
Run, Cho-yeon.

01:04:39.292 --> 01:04:40.501
Go, now!

01:05:05.484 --> 01:05:06.736
Young Master Park!

01:05:06.819 --> 01:05:07.987
You need to stop Mu-deok.

01:05:11.699 --> 01:05:12.533
Mu-deok.

01:05:15.369 --> 01:05:16.621
Please, stop her!

01:05:48.027 --> 01:05:50.029
Kill her. Hurry!

01:06:07.588 --> 01:06:08.798
Father!

01:06:10.091 --> 01:06:11.968
Father! Father!

01:06:12.677 --> 01:06:13.511
Father!

01:06:15.346 --> 01:06:16.180
Father!

01:06:17.765 --> 01:06:19.558
Father!

01:06:21.268 --> 01:06:22.645
Father! No!

01:06:23.270 --> 01:06:24.855
Father!

01:06:30.695 --> 01:06:32.238
Father!

01:06:35.241 --> 01:06:36.242
Yes, daddy.

01:06:43.708 --> 01:06:45.334
Father, no!

01:06:49.797 --> 01:06:50.715
Naksu.

01:06:52.341 --> 01:06:54.760
Kill those who murdered your father.

01:07:00.141 --> 01:07:01.350
Father!

01:07:03.477 --> 01:07:04.729
Father!

01:07:06.105 --> 01:07:06.939
Father!

01:07:37.011 --> 01:07:39.013
How dare you show your face here?

01:07:40.473 --> 01:07:42.016
Capture that criminal Jin Mu!

01:07:43.100 --> 01:07:45.144
I, Assistant Gwanju Jin Mu,

01:07:45.227 --> 01:07:47.104
am here to catch a soul shifter.

01:07:49.690 --> 01:07:53.027
Naksu, who has shifted her soul,
is hidden within the walls of Songrim.

01:07:54.153 --> 01:07:56.197
- Naksu?
- Lord Park!

01:08:00.743 --> 01:08:01.786
We have a problem.

01:08:02.286 --> 01:08:04.789
An assassin has appeared in Sejukwon.

01:08:07.208 --> 01:08:10.377
And that assassin has murdered
Lord Jin in cold blood.

01:08:11.378 --> 01:08:14.256
That very assassin is the one
I have been after. Naksu.

01:08:15.007 --> 01:08:15.883
That's not true.

01:08:16.717 --> 01:08:17.593
It was…

01:08:18.260 --> 01:08:19.470
it was Mu-deok who did it.

01:08:19.553 --> 01:08:21.263
Indeed. I am saying that Mu-deok…

01:08:22.139 --> 01:08:23.349
is Naksu.

01:08:30.731 --> 01:08:31.774
An assassin!

01:08:32.441 --> 01:08:34.318
An assassin has appeared in Sejukwon!

01:09:06.976 --> 01:09:08.394
Get her.

01:09:30.416 --> 01:09:32.001
- After her!
- Yes, sir!

01:11:12.184 --> 01:11:13.269
Mu-deok.

01:11:16.272 --> 01:11:17.106
Mu…

01:11:17.189 --> 01:11:18.107
Mu-deok.

01:11:21.527 --> 01:11:22.444
Mu-deok.

01:11:27.199 --> 01:11:28.033
Mu-deok.

01:11:34.123 --> 01:11:34.957
Jang Uk?

01:11:49.471 --> 01:11:50.806
I did this, right?

01:11:52.516 --> 01:11:53.475
I did this.

01:11:56.020 --> 01:11:57.021
I…

01:12:18.709 --> 01:12:19.543
Just one.

01:12:22.296 --> 01:12:25.174
You are the one that
I will be wearing for the rest of my life.

01:12:26.050 --> 01:12:28.635
I have never given
such a ring to anyone else.

01:12:31.889 --> 01:12:34.141
It means if I become Naksu,
I'll be in danger.

01:12:34.725 --> 01:12:38.020
What happens to me then
will have nothing to do with you.

01:12:40.731 --> 01:12:41.565
Why?

01:12:42.149 --> 01:12:44.360
Because we will no longer be
master and pupil?

01:12:44.443 --> 01:12:46.236
You will no longer have to protect me.

01:12:46.779 --> 01:12:49.031
Nor will I have a reason
to go easy on you.

01:12:50.282 --> 01:12:52.493
Because that was our promise
from the very beginning.

01:12:52.993 --> 01:12:54.370
Then promise me one more thing.

01:12:54.870 --> 01:12:56.330
When you regain your energy,

01:12:57.039 --> 01:12:59.291
if you must draw that sword
and point it at someone,

01:13:00.584 --> 01:13:02.294
point it at me before anyone else.

01:13:03.629 --> 01:13:04.713
You stab me,

01:13:04.797 --> 01:13:07.216
and I'll take responsibility
for setting Naksu upon the world,

01:13:08.217 --> 01:13:09.093
and I will die.

01:13:16.183 --> 01:13:17.184
Jang Uk!

01:13:21.647 --> 01:13:22.856
Jang Uk!

01:14:28.839 --> 01:14:29.756
After her!

01:15:12.382 --> 01:15:13.592
Uk…

01:15:21.058 --> 01:15:22.518
Uk!

01:16:14.820 --> 01:16:15.654
I think…

01:16:19.199 --> 01:16:22.411
somehow, Uk always knew
that Mu-deok was Naksu.

01:16:24.121 --> 01:16:25.205
Jin Mu…

01:16:26.540 --> 01:16:29.501
is raiding Jeongjingak
to find proof of that as we speak.

01:16:35.048 --> 01:16:36.592
I was aware of it as well.

01:16:37.801 --> 01:16:39.636
Please, allow me to go and find her

01:16:39.720 --> 01:16:41.888
and find out
what it is that really happened.

01:16:42.389 --> 01:16:45.392
You are Seo family's heir.

01:16:46.393 --> 01:16:49.146
You did not know anything.

01:16:50.647 --> 01:16:53.609
From this moment on, you are forbidden
from leaving the premises.

01:17:05.621 --> 01:17:06.830
Father died

01:17:07.623 --> 01:17:09.833
at the hands of that assassin.

01:17:10.917 --> 01:17:12.210
I will confront her

01:17:13.462 --> 01:17:15.422
and kill her no matter what.

01:17:18.300 --> 01:17:19.343
No, you can't.

01:17:22.804 --> 01:17:26.475
We must find that body
and bring it here alive.

01:17:28.644 --> 01:17:31.605
Naksu is just the soul
that's in that body.

01:17:32.272 --> 01:17:35.400
I must find out who that body belonged to.

01:17:37.903 --> 01:17:40.405
Bring her… at all costs.

01:17:50.707 --> 01:17:53.335
The assassin who performed
the alchemy of souls

01:17:53.418 --> 01:17:55.671
turned out to be Naksu.

01:17:56.505 --> 01:18:00.092
I captured an individual
when I killed Naksu's men.

01:18:00.175 --> 01:18:02.844
And that was how I knew
that Naksu was still alive.

01:18:03.553 --> 01:18:06.056
All this time,
I've been searching for Naksu

01:18:06.139 --> 01:18:07.724
in order to clear my name.

01:18:07.808 --> 01:18:11.478
And this Naksu was the daughter
of Cho Chung killed by the four families?

01:18:12.354 --> 01:18:15.482
And she was hiding
in Songrim to avenge her father?

01:18:16.358 --> 01:18:19.111
Did Jang Uk keep her
by his side despite knowing this?

01:18:19.194 --> 01:18:20.987
We will never know since he has died.

01:18:21.071 --> 01:18:24.700
But I ask that
you punish Songrim for this.

01:18:29.246 --> 01:18:30.789
And what happened to Naksu?

01:18:30.872 --> 01:18:32.874
Cheonbugwan's men are after her.

01:18:33.458 --> 01:18:37.879
She has run wild,
so she will be petrified and die.

01:18:55.147 --> 01:18:56.189
Mu-deok.

01:18:59.735 --> 01:19:01.319
Mu… Mu-deok.

01:19:05.949 --> 01:19:06.908
Jang Uk!

01:19:27.179 --> 01:19:31.141
I'm not even allowed
to wear mourning clothes

01:19:31.725 --> 01:19:33.935
nor give him a proper funeral.

01:19:34.686 --> 01:19:37.773
How can they burn the young master's body
in such a place?

01:19:40.233 --> 01:19:41.568
That cannot happen!

01:19:42.569 --> 01:19:44.529
I beg you, stop them, please!

01:19:46.156 --> 01:19:47.532
Songrim can't…

01:19:49.075 --> 01:19:50.035
step in…

01:19:51.745 --> 01:19:53.205
on this matter at all.

01:19:55.373 --> 01:19:56.333
I am sorry.

01:20:16.520 --> 01:20:17.729
Young Master…

01:21:19.666 --> 01:21:21.835
What am I doing here right now?

01:21:26.506 --> 01:21:27.591
At least…

01:21:31.678 --> 01:21:34.014
I can no longer hear the bells anymore.

01:21:40.020 --> 01:21:42.439
Naksu will go to the soul shifters' grave.

01:21:43.231 --> 01:21:46.359
There she'll meet… her end.

01:22:02.334 --> 01:22:05.295
The King's Star who has been
granted the power of the skies.

01:22:06.671 --> 01:22:09.507
This is not your end yet…

01:22:11.009 --> 01:22:11.885
Jang Uk.

01:22:30.946 --> 01:22:31.905
Get out of here!

01:22:33.448 --> 01:22:34.491
Please, be careful.

01:22:40.205 --> 01:22:41.373
Young Master Jang.

01:26:18.381 --> 01:26:22.427
A NEW ALCHEMY OF SOULS STORY
WILL BEGIN IN DECEMBER
